<p>A rejected claim becomes a work item with a clock, not another unmarked folder in the shared drive.</p>
<div class="stat"><b class="num">SLA</b><span>Every rejection carries an owner, a reason and a deadline.</span><em>Tracked to close</em></div>
</article>
