<section class="sec" id="workflow">
<div class="hd2">
<div><div class="eyeb">The resubmission loop</div><h2>Four steps, one ledger.</h2></div>
<p class="sub">A rejected claim should not vanish into a queue. Bix forces a workflow on every denial: same data, same owner, same clock.</p>
</div>
<div class="flow">
<article class="step gl"><div class="no">01</div><h3>Submit</h3><p>Claim dispatched to the right payer portal with the right attachment and pre-auth reference.</p></article>
<article class="step gl"><div class="no">02</div><h3>Adjudicate</h3><p>Remittance advice pulled and paired with the original claim. Matching is reconciled, not guessed.</p></article>
<article class="step gl"><div class="no">03</div><h3>Detect</h3><p>Denials categorised by payer, code, clinician and facility the moment they land.</p></article>
<article class="step gl"><div class="no">04</div><h3>Resubmit</h3><p>Each rejection lands in a tracked workflow with owner, SLA and reason — nothing sits unseen.</p></article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="contact">
<div class="hd2">
<div><div class="eyeb">Talk to us</div><h2>Plug Bix into one facility. See the first pattern before the next pay cycle.</h2></div>
<p class="sub">We work with provider finance, RCM and coding leaders running hospitals, clinics and provider groups across the UAE and broader GCC.</p>
</div>
<div class="cwrap">
<div class="cmain">
@* The design's form is a mock — its script hides the fields and shows a thank-you
   without sending anything. Wired to a real endpoint so an enquiry is not discarded. *@
<form class="cform" id="bixf" method="post" action="/Home/LandingContact" novalidate>
@Html.AntiForgeryToken()
<div class="f2">
<label><span>Your name</span><input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Layla Al Mansouri" /></label>
<label><span>Work email</span><input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@@provider.ae" /></label>
</div>
<div class="f2">
<label><span>Facility or group</span><input type="text" name="facility" required autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Al Noor Medical Group" /></label>
<label><span>Live claim types</span><select name="claims"><option>1 – 3</option><option selected>4 – 10</option><option>11 – 25</option><option>25+</option></select></label>
</div>
<fieldset class="fs">
<legend>Portals you sync from today</legend>
<div class="fchips">
